{"kind":"article","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt UI is a full presentation layer over the reader engine:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a tabbed carousel of edition archives, the reader screen with its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation bar, content browser, splash, and settings, plus bookmarks,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloads, and search — all themeable to your brand and extensible through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"delegates for paywalls, sharing, commenting, audio, and adverts.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The entry point is ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", driven by a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/GlobalConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" carrying your credentials, branding, and delegates.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This page assumes the SDK is installed and initialized — see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Getting-Started","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"text":"Quick Start","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Quick-Start"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/GlobalConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with your credentials and basic theming:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import PSReader","","let globalConfig = PSReader.GlobalConfiguration(","    apiKey: apiKey,","    accountGUID: accountGUID,","    primaryFont: .systemFont(ofSize: 12),","    secondaryFont: .systemFont(ofSize: 12),","    brandColor: UIColor(dynamicProvider: {","        $0.userInterfaceStyle == .dark ? .white : .black","    })",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The primary font is used for titles, headlines, and publication names. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"secondary font covers the remaining UI. The brand color is used as an accent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"throughout the SDK. See ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Theming-and-Customization"},{"text":" for the full","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appearance system, including dark mode.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then create a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController"},{"text":" using a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"shortcode","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dynamicArchive"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let carouselVC = PSReader.CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    sections: [","        .dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\"),","        .subsections(\"My Content\", [","            .init(name: \"Bookmarks\", type: .bookmarks(type: .all)),","            .init(name: \"Downloads\", type: .downloads(type: .all))","        ])","    ]",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can now push, present, or embed the ","type":"text"},{"code":"CarouselViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as needed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Carousel-Setup","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for more detail on sections, content types, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layout options.","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Manual Configuration","anchor":"Manual-Configuration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you need to use explicit GUIDs instead of a shortcode, replace","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dynamicArchive"},{"text":" with a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".section"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".subsections"},{"text":" entry using the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appropriate content type:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ Feed edition archive with the publication's GUID",".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .feedArchive(guid: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\")))","","\/\/ Replica archive with the replica publication's GUID",".section(.init(name: \"Editions\", type: .replicaArchive(guid: \"REPLICA_PUBLICATION_GUID\")))"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Replica-and-Feed-Editions","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to determine which content type matches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"your publication."}]},{"text":"Embedding in SwiftUI","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Embedding-in-SwiftUI"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wrap the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" in a "},{"code":"UIViewControllerRepresentable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use it in a SwiftUI view hierarchy:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftUI","import PSReader","","struct ReaderView: UIViewControllerRepresentable {","    func makeUIViewController(context: Context) -> PSReader.CarouselViewController {","        let globalConfig = PSReader.GlobalConfiguration(","            apiKey: \"API_KEY\",","            accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\"","        )","        return PSReader.CarouselViewController(","            globalConfig: globalConfig,","            sections: [","                .dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\")","            ]","        )","    }","","    func updateUIViewController(_ uiViewController: PSReader.CarouselViewController, context: Context) {}","}"]},{"anchor":"Using-a-Coordinator-as-a-Delegate","text":"Using a Coordinator as a Delegate","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK makes wide use of delegate protocols (see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/GlobalConfiguration","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"When embedding in SwiftUI, you can implement delegates on a "},{"code":"Coordinator","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lifecycle is tied to the representable:"}]},{"code":["struct ReaderView: UIViewControllerRepresentable {","    func makeCoordinator() -> Coordinator {","        Coordinator()","    }","","    func makeUIViewController(context: Context) -> PSReader.CarouselViewController {","        let globalConfig = PSReader.GlobalConfiguration(","            apiKey: \"API_KEY\",","            accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\",","            navigationDelegate: context.coordinator","        )","        return PSReader.CarouselViewController(","            globalConfig: globalConfig,","            sections: [","                .dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\")","            ]","        )","    }","","    func updateUIViewController(_ uiViewController: PSReader.CarouselViewController, context: Context) {}","","    class Coordinator: NavigationDelegate {","        func willPresentReplicaReader() {","            \/\/ Track analytics, adjust UI state, etc.","        }","","        func willDismissReplicaReader() {","            \/\/ Restore UI state, etc.","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The same approach works for any delegate — have "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Coordinator"},{"type":"text","text":" conform to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallDelegate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ShareDelegate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", or any combination you need and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"context.coordinator"},{"type":"text","text":" to the corresponding "},{"code":"GlobalConfiguration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Headers","type":"heading","text":"Headers"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass your own header view controller, pinned above the carousel content (for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example a branded title bar). Set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hidesHeaderOnScroll"},{"type":"text","text":" to have the SDK slide it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"away as the content scrolls and reveal it again when scrolling back up or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"changing page:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var carouselConfig = PSReader.CarouselConfiguration(globalConfig: globalConfig)","carouselConfig.hidesHeaderOnScroll = true","","let carouselVC = PSReader.CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    carouselConfig: carouselConfig,","    header: myHeaderViewController,","    sections: [ \/* ... *\/ ]",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"text":"Presenting Modally","type":"heading","anchor":"Presenting-Modally"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When you present the carousel modally, you’ll need to give users a way to close","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it — typically a close button in your header, which you’re free to build","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"yourself.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For this common case the SDK also offers a prebuilt option:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/DismissHeaderViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" provides a ready-made close button that dismisses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the carousel on tap (or calls your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onClose"},{"type":"text","text":"). Keep "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hidesHeaderOnScroll"},{"type":"text","text":" at its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" so the button stays reachable:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let carouselVC = PSReader.CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    carouselConfig: carouselConfig,","    header: PSReader.DismissHeaderViewController(),","    sections: [ \/* ... *\/ ]",")","","present(carouselVC, animated: true)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you are embedding the carousel inside your own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UINavigationController"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"embedInNavigationController"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the carousel configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to prevent the SDK from creating a second navigation controller, which would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"result in double navigation bars:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["carouselConfig.embedInNavigationController = false"]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Integration-Levels","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Building-a-Custom-Reader-UI"],"generated":true,"title":"Integration Levels"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Prebuilt-UI"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ship a complete reader experience with the carousel and the SDK’s prebuilt"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"screens."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/GlobalConfiguration","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Demo-Project"],"title":"Essentials"},{"anchor":"Setup-and-Customization","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Carousel-Setup","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Theming-and-Customization","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/The-Reader-Experience","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Standalone-View-Controllers","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Deep-Linking